# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Author: Daniel S.
# Date: 11/11/2026
# File: .dockerignore
# Version: V1.2
# Description: Files left out of the Docker image. .env is NOT listed here on
#              purpose, the image carries it so a rebuild picks up changes (DB-5).
#              Comments must be on their own line, a "#" after a pattern
#              would become part of the pattern.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python Virtual Environments
.venv/
venv/
# Python's Compiled Cache Folders
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
# Compiled Python Files
*.pyc
# Git History Isn't Needed To Run The App
.git/
# Unit Tests Run On The Laptop, Not In The Image
tests/
